}
```

When `backend === 'supabase'`, it hydrates with empty data and returns without loading real data. This is a bug - it should call `refresh()` or equivalent to load data from Supabase.

Also, the `refresh()` method:
```typescript
refresh(): void {
  if (this.config.useMockApi || this.config.backend === 'supabase') return;
  // ... makes HTTP calls to /api/v1 endpoints
}
```

So `refresh()` doesn't work with Supabase either! It only works with the REST API.

